, deletion, and stale privileged context."],"finding_ids":[],"id":"AGT-04","source_ids":["OWASP-AGENTIC"],"sources":["https://genai.owasp.org/resource/owasp-top-10-for-agentic-applications-for-2026/"],"status":"review_required","suppressed_finding_ids":[],"title":"Protect retrieval and persistent memory","validation":"hybrid"},{"alignment_source_ids":["CSA-MAESTRO","OWASP-AISVS-C9"],"assurance":"Not established by this static scan","automated_rule_ids":[],"category":"Agent behavior and context","checks":["Constrain delegated tasks and verify messages against authenticated senders, expected schemas, and allowed transitions.","Test impersonation, conflicting instructions, cascading failure, and privilege growth across handoffs."],"finding_ids":[],"id":"AGT-05","source_ids":["OWASP-AGENTIC"],"sources":["https://genai.owasp.org/resource/owasp-top-10-for-agentic-applications-for-2026/"],"status":"runtime_validation_required","suppressed_finding_ids":[],"title":"Keep objectives and authority bounded across agents","validation":"dynamic"},{"alignment_source_ids":["AIUC1-Q3-2026"],"assurance":"Not established by this static scan","automated_rule_ids":[],"category":"Agent behavior and context","checks":["Inventory skill files, prompts, hooks, memory seed files, MCP configuration, and other executable workflow inputs.","Require review for changes that add commands, access, or persistence; external repository text cannot become trusted policy."],"finding_ids":[],"id":"AGT-06","source_ids":["MITRE-ATLAS","NCSC-SECURE-AI"],"sources":["https://github.com/mitre-atlas/atlas-data","https://www.ncsc.gov.uk/collection/guidelines-secure-ai-system-development"],"status":"review_required","suppressed_finding_ids":[],"title":"Protect agent configuration and skills","validation":"hybrid"},{"alignment_source_ids":[],"assurance":"Not established by this static scan","automated_rule_ids":[],"category":"Agent behavior and context","checks":["Apply destination and data policies to URLs, searches, tickets, messages, uploads, and telemetry generated by agents.","Use canary data to test encoded leakage and combinations of otherwise permitted tools."],"finding_ids":[],"id":"AGT-07","source_ids":["OWASP-MCP-CS"],"sources":["https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/MCP_Security_Cheat_Sheet.html"],"status":"runtime_validation_required","suppressed_finding_ids":[],"title":"Prevent sensitive context leaving through legitimate tools","validation":"dynamic"},{"alignment_source_ids":[],"assurance":"Partial static coverage only; absence of a finding is not a pass","automated_rule_ids":["AI002","AI003","AI012"],"category":"Execution and application security","checks":["Find shell execution and constructed command strings; use fixed executables, argument arrays, and allowed argument values.","Test untrusted tool inputs containing shell syntax, option injection, command substitution, and hostile filenames."],"finding_ids":["979d192981c1785a2394fe19","0fa7e450cd583d78646ef397"],"id":"EXEC-01","source_ids":["OWASP-MCP10","OWASP-OUTPUT2025"],"sources":["https://owasp.org/projects/mcp-top-10","https://genai.owasp.org/llmrisk/llm052025-improper-output-handling/"],"status":"findings_detected","suppressed_finding_ids":[],"title":"Prevent shell and command injection","validation":"hybrid"},{"alignment_source_ids":["OWASP-AISVS-C9","AIUC1-Q3-2026"],"assurance":"Partial static coverage only; absence of a finding is not a pass","automated_rule_ids":["AI001","AI013"],"category":"Execution and application security","checks":["Locate eval, exec, dynamic imports, templates, notebooks, and interpreter tools accepting model or user content.","Run required code execution in a disposable restricted environment with explicit filesystem, network, CPU, and time limits."],"finding_ids":["b1b0f0a3f33fe93875fcb58a"],"id":"EXEC-02","source_ids":["OWASP-AGENT-CS"],"sources":["https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/AI_Agent_Security_Cheat_Sheet.html"],"status":"findings_detected","sup